ant advantages: a large fundraising lead, over $11 million in cash, and a long history of winning by margins beyond what polls suggested. But the political environment appears favorable to Democrats, and headlines on heating oil costs and contentious debates have kept Collins on the defensive. Prediction markets give Jackson roughly a 55-58% chance, consistent with a narrow Democratic edge in a race that remains genuinely competitive.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7341, "margin": 3.16}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6906, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.626, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6915, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.5751, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6364, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6474, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6668, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6495, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.6328, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6994, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6388, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6279, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.5727, "margin": 1.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6061, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6059, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6373, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6384, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6413, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6281, "margin": 2.2}]}